  "about_item": [
    "1. Dog-Friendly Wand That Makes Bath Time a Breeze: The wand sprayer is shaped to fit your dog’s body. It soaks through thick coats fast, saving time and water—plus, it’s easy to use with one hand so you can keep the other free to comfort your pup",
    "2. Three-Function Sprayer: Features three spray modes to handle every stage of bath time: a gentle narrow spray for sensitive areas, a strong rinse for quick cleanups, and a built-in pause button that helps conserve water while you lather. Simple thumb control makes switching effortless",
    "3. Built-In Brush for Easy Wash & Groom: The integrated brush works like a water comb—gently scrubbing while rinsing to remove dirt, loose fur, and tangles. It makes bath time faster, cleaner, and more comfortable for your pet",
    "4. Extra-Long 100\" Hose: The extra-long hose gives you maximum reach and flexibility, making it easy to bathe pets of all sizes, without feeling restricted",
    "5. Easy and Fast Installation: The package comes with all tools needed for installation. The illustrated instruction tells you installation step clearly. A super quality Teflon tape is always helpful during your installation"
  ],
