        "position": 1,
        "title": "A Must-Have for Anyone Who Bathes Large Dogs Outdoors",
        "text": "If you own large dogs, especially breeds that love mud as much as mine do, this shower attachment is worth every penny.I have two bloodhounds that seem determined to find every muddy puddle in the yard. During the warmer months, I’d much rather bathe them outside than spend an hour cleaning my bathtub afterward. This attachment makes that job much easier.Installation was quick, the connections were secure, and the sprayer provides plenty of water pressure for rinsing thick coats. The different spray modes are useful depending on whether you’re soaking the coat, rinsing shampoo, or cleaning muddy paws.The biggest advantage is convenience. Instead of dragging two muddy dogs through the house, I can wash them where they made the mess and keep the cleanup outside where it belongs.If you regularly bathe large dogs outdoors, this is a practical, well-made accessory that makes the job significantly easier.",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "July 7, 2026",
        "author": "C in KS",
        "author_link": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AEDUY4R2LEIVAG4LLV66CUGNZUUA?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top",
        "author_image": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX48_.png"
      },
      {
        "position": 2,
        "title": "makes giving my dog a bath so convenient",
        "text": "This has made giving my dog (who does not like baths) convenient and has made it easier! I like that I can attach it in my shower/tub but also on my outdoor shower for when we do baths outside. It is super easy to attach and detach when needed. The pause mode is a game changer when bathing my dog, not having to turn the water off and on, and not have to worry about accidentally spraying water everywhere etc, it is my favorite feature. The water pressure is also perfect.",
        "rating": 4,
        "date": "July 11, 2026",
        "author": "Sambora Christyne",
        "author_link": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AEZOELBSGCYMVTPVHVQDWW3P62JA?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top",
        "author_image": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/a0a47c24-52c0-4562-bcd7-8a406bf44a28._CR0%2C0%2C417%2C417_UX460_SX48_.jpg",
        "helpful_votes": "One person found this helpful"
      },
      {
        "position": 3,
        "title": "For Animals and their Best Friends",
        "text": "I find that this shower attachments works great for pets and people. I got it for our dogs to start bathing them outdoors and it works wonders. It’s a durable, stainless steel, handheld attachment and hose. The hose connects directly to the outside spout and is super long while the attachment operates in three modes. I prefer the rain mode but the nozzle modes are good for getting mud and stubborn dirt off their bodies. During the warmer seasons, my dogs prefer outdoor showers compared to indoor.It’s great to use it for a variety of reasons. I also use it to rinse my hands or feet when working outdoors and to even water plants. Although I still need my water hose for my lawn and washing cars, this is great to use with my dogs, plants, and myself. It’s a great value, too!",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "July 1, 2026",
        "author": "S Nicker28",
        "author_link": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AFUMTVIVRSR4YBYDD7OBVJVT6MHQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top",
        "author_image": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX48_.png"
      },
      {
        "position": 4,
        "title": "Convenient for outdoor pup baths-humans too",
        "text": "This dog shower attachment has made outdoor baths so much easier! After messy walking trips or playtime my dogs can sometimes come home covered in mud and dirt, and this makes cleanup quick and simple. The different spray settings are great for tougher messes and gentler areas, plus the pause feature helps save water. The hose gives plenty of reach, connects easily, and feels very durable. Definitely recommend for anyone who regularly washes their dogs outside. It also looks nice, like I almost didn't want to put it outdoors lol",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "July 8, 2026",
        "author": "Missez London",
        "author_link": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AFBMKR3WJSJXUOSNDHOOG4TKUDVQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top",
        "author_image": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/2a7d9711-39b2-4165-817a-6459ed4cb78f._CR0%2C26%2C281%2C281_UX460_SX48_.jpg",
