      {
        "position": 5,
        "title": "Hand held showerhead for dogs",
        "text": "Although this product comes with a tube, I only used the showerhead with an electric pump. I like how this showerhead has the silicon spikes, I use it as a combo/massager to massage my dog during shower. It's very easy to control with one hand so my other hand can hold my dog.",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "July 18, 2026",
        "author": "law",
        "author_link": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AGKZ7U4XAN4TN6LTK2FRLPB7XGAA?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top",
        "author_image": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX48_.png"
      },
      {
        "position": 6,
        "title": "Great attachment for dogs and even plants!",
        "text": "I will admit that I was a little overwhelmed when I opened the box. However, this was the easiest to put together and use. It has a ton of different options once it’s on and I will be using it both inside for my dog but also outside for my plants that are right by the outdoor spout. It’s so easy to move and use that it’s silly to not use it in both places. While I won’t leave it outside, I couldn’t be happier with this.",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "June 20, 2026",
        "author": "Rose Thorne",
        "author_link": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AEPGWSJVGEPPHMRSYVHVYWMPELTA?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top",
        "author_image": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/31035cf3-bbb1-476c-a21b-9e8e40a3fb4a._CR8%2C0%2C483%2C483_SX460_SX48_.jpg"
      },
      {
        "position": 7,
        "title": "Great buy",
        "text": "We take our dogs to the lake all the time, and they always come home absolutely filthy with mud, sand, and who knows what else. Washing them outside with a regular garden hose has always been a hassle, so this dog shower attachment has been a huge improvement.The three spray modes are really useful because you can switch between them depending on what you're rinsing off. The stronger setting helps remove stubborn dirt, while the gentler spray is great for rinsing around their face and legs. It definitely makes bath time faster and much more efficient. The pause mode is also convenient when you need a moment to lather up your dog without wasting water.The 100-inch stainless steel hose provides plenty of reach, and everything feels sturdy and well made. It connected easily to our outdoor faucet and worked exactly as expected. The water pressure was great too and so far, the material has not rusted outside.If you regularly bathe your dogs outside, especially after trips to the lake, beach, or park, this is a great accessory to have. It saves time, works well, and makes the whole process much easier.",
